--- !u!114 &1732795399
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 7
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Tell me human, do you know what you're really asking for? To be bound
    to a wolf? To be accepted by Fenrir himself?
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 2054823944}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795400
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 6
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'She circles you slowly, graceful as a cat.

'
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795401
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 5
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: You carry Lycaon's token. How impressive.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 2054823944}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795402
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 4
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: You turn to find a tall woman in a deep burgundy gown that shimmers
    in the torchlight. Her mask is an elegant copper fox adorned with feathers. Her
    amber eyes study you with predatory intelligence.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795403
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 3
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: There you are, little hunter. I've been watching you all evening.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 2054823944}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795404
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 2
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'As you step onto a torch lit terrace, a voice calls from behind: smooth,
    knowing, and with a hint of a french accent.'
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795405
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 1
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Tonight's ball has a wilder energy; music pulses with primal rhythm
    and the guests don't hold back when dancing. You've been searching for Claudine,
    though King Lycaon said she would find you first.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1732795406
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 11
  indentLevel: 0
  text: Oh my lady, I know this is no small thing, but my love is true and I shall
    face any challenge to earn the right to stand beside my beloved.
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 1732795408}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &1732795407
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1732795394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 10
  indentLevel: 0
  text: Lady Cualdine, I humbly request your guidance. King Lycaon spoke highly you
    and your wisdom and I beg for the opportunity to demonstrate my devotion.
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 1732795408}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
